const CATS=[B('Emotional awareness','Hissiy ong'),B('Critical thinking','Tanqidiy fikrlash'),B('Verification','Tekshirish'),B('Everyday protection','Kundalik himoya'),B('Response & recovery','Javob va tiklanish')];
const LABS=[
 {title:B('The moment before a click','Bosishdan oldingi lahza'),subtitle:B('Why urgency changes the way we think.','Shoshilinchlik fikrlashimizga qanday ta’sir qiladi.'),name:CATS[0],teach:B('Fear, excitement, belonging and curiosity are ordinary human experiences. Scammers exploit them by shrinking the time we feel we have to think.','Qo‘rquv, hayajon, jamoaga tegishlilik va qiziqish — tabiiy hissiyotlar. Firibgarlar o‘ylash uchun vaqtimiz yo‘qdek tuyulishidan foydalanadi.'),extra:B('The clue is not that you feel something. The clue is when someone uses that feeling to rush you into a sensitive action. Pause before acting; slowing down is a skill.','Muammo hissiyotning o‘zida emas. Kimdir shu hissiyot orqali sizni maxfiy yoki xavfli qarorga shoshirayotganiga e’tibor bering. Harakatdan oldin bir lahza to‘xtang.'),principle:B('Strong judgment starts by noticing pressure, not by pretending you have no emotions.','To‘g‘ri qaror hissiyotsizlikdan emas, bosimni payqashdan boshlanadi.')},
 {title:B('Proof is not a screenshot','Dalil — shunchaki skrinshot emas'),subtitle:B('Learn to check a claim outside the claim itself.','Xabarni uning o‘zidan tashqarida tekshirishni o‘rganing.'),name:CATS[1],teach:B('A polished website, an official logo or hundreds of reposts can all appear convincing. Appearance and repetition are not proof. Ask who originated a claim and what independent evidence supports it.','Chiroyli sayt, rasmiy logotip yoki yuzlab ulashishlar ishonchli ko‘rinishi mumkin. Tashqi ko‘rinish va takrorlanish dalil emas. Xabar kimdan chiqqanini va mustaqil dalillarni tekshiring.'),extra:B('Leave the suspicious page. Search for the organization through a known official route, compare information, and look for an original announcement. This is often called lateral reading.','Shubhali sahifadan chiqing. Tashkilotni ishonchli rasmiy yo‘l bilan qidiring, ma’lumotlarni solishtiring va dastlabki e’lonni toping. Bu yonma-yon tekshirish usuliga yaqin.'),principle:B('A claim is not verified just because many copies of it exist.','Bir xabarning ko‘p nusxasi bo‘lishi uning to‘g‘riligini isbotlamaydi.')},
 {title:B('When a familiar voice lies','Tanish ovoz aldaganda'),subtitle:B('Identity needs independent confirmation in the AI era.','AI davrida shaxsni mustaqil tekshirish zarur.'),name:CATS[2],teach:B('AI can help create plausible text, images, audio and video. Old clues like spelling mistakes or strange-looking faces can be absent. An unexpected request must be verified independently, even if it sounds familiar.','AI ishonarli matn, rasm, audio va video yaratishi mumkin. Imlo xatosi yoki g‘alati yuz kabi eski belgilar bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Tanish eshitilsa ham, kutilmagan so‘rovni mustaqil tekshirish kerak.'),extra:B('Call back using a number you already know. Contact a person through an established channel. For family emergencies, an agreed private verification phrase can be an extra layer—not the only one.','Oldindan bilgan raqamingizga qayta qo‘ng‘iroq qiling. Odamga avvaldan ishonchli kanal orqali murojaat qiling. Oilada oldindan kelishilgan maxfiy ibora qo‘shimcha himoya bo‘lishi mumkin, ammo yagona tekshiruv emas.'),principle:B('The question is not “does it look real?” It is “what independently confirms it?”','Savol “haqiqiyga o‘xshaydimi?” emas, “buni mustaqil nima tasdiqlaydi?” bo‘lsin.')},
 {title:B('Protect what matters','Muhim narsalarni himoyalang'),subtitle:B('Security as a small collection of repeatable habits.','Xavfsizlik — takrorlanadigan oddiy odatlar.'),name:CATS[3],teach:B('Good judgment is stronger when basic protections are already in place. Unique passwords, multifactor authentication, legitimate updates and thoughtful sharing all reduce avoidable risk.','Asosiy himoya oldindan yoqilgan bo‘lsa, oqilona qaror yanada foydali bo‘ladi. Takrorlanmas parollar, ko‘p bosqichli tasdiqlash, rasmiy yangilanishlar va ma’lumotni ehtiyotkorlik bilan ulashish xavfni kamaytiradi.'),extra:B('Remember: a one-time sign-in code is a key, not an identity test for a stranger. A password manager can help generate and store unique passwords. Prefer phishing-resistant sign-in methods when available.','Esda tuting: bir martalik kirish kodi — kalit, notanish odam uchun shaxsni tekshirish vositasi emas. Parol menejeri takrorlanmas parollar yaratish va saqlashga yordam beradi. Imkon bo‘lsa, fishingga chidamli kirish usullarini tanlang.'),principle:B('Protection works through habits, not one magical application.','Himoya birgina mo‘jizaviy ilovadan emas, odatlardan boshlanadi.')},
 {title:B('After something goes wrong','Xato yuz bergandan keyin'),subtitle:B('Recover quickly, ask for help and reject shame.','Tezroq tiklaning, yordam so‘rang, uyalmang.'),name:CATS[4],teach:B('Even thoughtful people make mistakes. What matters next is reducing harm: stop engaging, secure affected accounts through official channels, preserve appropriate evidence and seek help.','Ehtiyotkor insonlar ham xato qilishi mumkin. Keyingi qadam muhim: aloqani to‘xtatish, rasmiy kanal orqali hisobni himoyalash, kerakli dalillarni saqlash va yordam so‘rash.'),extra:B('Clicking a link is different from installing a file, entering a password or sending money. Different events require different responses. Threats or blackmail should never be handled alone by a student.','Havolani ochish, fayl o‘rnatish, parol kiritish yoki pul yuborish — turli holatlar. Har biriga mos chora kerak. Tahdid yoki shantajga o‘quvchi yolg‘iz qarshi turmasligi kerak.'),principle:B('Reporting is a strength. Shame is a tool scammers can exploit.','Xabar berish — kuchlilik belgisi. Uyaltirishdan firibgarlar ham foydalanishi mumkin.')}
];
const MISSIONS=[
 {title:B('A friend, a different number','Do‘stingizning yangi raqami'),tag:B('IMPERSONATION / URGENCY','O‘ZINI BOSHQA ODAM DEB TANISHTIRISH'),scene:B('“It’s me, Aziz. My phone is broken. I need 200,000 so‘m right now. Don’t call—my microphone is damaged. I’ll pay you tomorrow.”','“Men Azizman. Telefonim buzildi. Hozir 200 000 so‘m kerak. Qo‘ng‘iroq qilma, mikrofoni ishlamayapti. Ertaga qaytaraman.”'),choices:[B('Send the money because you know Aziz.','Azizni taniganingiz uchun pul yuboring.'),B('Call Aziz using his previously saved contact or ask him in person.','Azizga avvalgi saqlangan raqami orqali qo‘ng‘iroq qiling yoki yuzma-yuz so‘rang.'),B('Ask the new number to send a selfie.','Yangi raqamdan selfi so‘rang.')],correct:1,why:B('A selfie could also be stolen or generated. The independent, previously trusted channel is what matters.','Selfi ham o‘g‘irlangan yoki sun’iy yaratilgan bo‘lishi mumkin. Muhimi — avvaldan ishonchli mustaqil aloqa kanali.')},
 {title:B('The scholarship countdown','Grant uchun teskari hisob'),tag:B('HOPE / ARTIFICIAL DEADLINE','UMID / SUN’IY MUDDAT'),scene:B('An attractive scholarship page says: “Only 3 spots left. Upload your ID and pay a small processing fee in the next 12 minutes.” It displays a polished university logo.','Chiroyli grant sahifasida: “Faqat 3 ta joy qoldi. 12 daqiqa ichida shaxsni tasdiqlovchi hujjat yuklang va kichik to‘lov qiling.” Universitet logotipi ham bor.'),choices:[B('Use a search engine to find the university’s official scholarship page and compare the offer.','Universitetning rasmiy grant sahifasini mustaqil topib, taklifni solishtiring.'),B('Trust the logo and apply quickly.','Logotipga ishonib, tez ariza yuboring.'),B('Ask the website’s own chat assistant if it is legitimate.','Saytdagi chat-botdan haqiqiyligini so‘rang.')],correct:0,why:B('A scam site can control its own chat and logo. A verified external source is stronger evidence.','Soxta sayt o‘z logotipi va chat-botini boshqaradi. Mustaqil rasmiy manba kuchliroq dalil.')},
 {title:B('The school timetable file','Maktab jadvali fayli'),tag:B('TRUSTED AUTHORITY / DEVICE SAFETY','RAH BARIYATGA ISHONCH / QURILMA'),scene:B('A message pretending to be from a school group admin offers “NEW_EXAM_SCHEDULE.apk”. It says you must install it to see tomorrow’s exam room.','Maktab guruhi administratoriga o‘xshagan akkaunt “NEW_EXAM_SCHEDULE.apk” faylini yuboradi. Ertangi imtihon xonasini ko‘rish uchun o‘rnatish kerak, deydi.'),choices:[B('Install it because it mentions your school.','Maktab nomi yozilgani uchun o‘rnating.'),B('Forward it to the class for testing.','Sinash uchun sinf guruhiga yuboring.'),B('Do not install it; verify the schedule through an official teacher or school channel.','O‘rnatmang; jadvalni ustoz yoki maktabning rasmiy kanali orqali tekshiring.')],correct:2,why:B('Unexpected installation files can be harmful. Never forward unverified files as a “test”.','Kutilmagan o‘rnatish fayllari xavfli bo‘lishi mumkin. Tekshirish uchun ham shubhali faylni boshqalarga yubormang.')},
 {title:B('Tomorrow, school is cancelled?','Ertaga dars bo‘lmaydimi?'),tag:B('MISINFORMATION / AI MEDIA','YOLG‘ON AXBOROT / AI MEDIA'),scene:B('A short video appears to show a principal cancelling classes tomorrow. It has thousands of views, but the school’s official channels have posted nothing.','Qisqa videoda direktor ertangi darslar bekor qilinishini aytayotgandek ko‘rinadi. Minglab ko‘rish bor, ammo maktab rasmiy kanallarida xabar yo‘q.'),choices:[B('Treat the video as confirmed because many people watched it.','Ko‘p ko‘rilgani uchun videoga ishoning.'),B('Check the school’s established official channels or contact school staff.','Maktabning avvaldan ma’lum rasmiy kanallarini yoki xodimlarini tekshiring.'),B('Share it with “maybe true” in the caption.','“Balki rost” deb ulashing.')],correct:1,why:B('A realistic video and a large view count are not independent verification. Avoid spreading uncertainty as fact.','Haqiqiyga o‘xshagan video va ko‘p ko‘rish dalil emas. Tasdiqlanmagan xabarni fakt sifatida tarqatmang.')},
 {title:B('Free game currency','O‘yindagi bepul valyuta'),tag:B('REWARD / ACCOUNT TAKEOVER','MUKOFOT / HISOBNI EGALLASH'),scene:B('A “support moderator” says you won free game currency. To claim it, send a screenshot of the one-time login code just sent to your phone.','“Yordam xodimi” o‘yindagi bepul valyutani yutganingizni aytadi. Olish uchun telefonga kelgan bir martalik kirish kodi skrinshotini so‘raydi.'),choices:[B('Send it; the code expires anyway.','Yuboring; kod baribir tezda eskiradi.'),B('Ask the person to promise not to use the code.','Koddan foydalanmaslikka va’da berishini so‘rang.'),B('Keep the code private, ignore the request, and use official game support if needed.','Kodni sir tuting, so‘rovni rad eting va zarur bo‘lsa o‘yinning rasmiy yordam kanalidan foydalaning.')],correct:2,why:B('One-time codes can grant immediate access even when they expire soon. They are not prizes or identity proofs for strangers.','Bir martalik kodlar qisqa muddat ichida ham hisobga kirish imkonini berishi mumkin. Ular sovrin yoki begona uchun shaxsni isbotlash vositasi emas.')},
 {title:B('The threatening message','Tahdidli xabar'),tag:B('FEAR / RESPONSE','QO‘RQUV / JAVOB'),scene:B('An unknown account claims to have private photos of a student and threatens to publish them unless money is sent. They demand secrecy.','Notanish akkaunt o‘quvchining shaxsiy suratlari borligini aytib, pul berilmasa tarqatishini bilan tahdid qiladi. Hech kimga aytmaslikni talab qiladi.'),choices:[B('Pay immediately and tell nobody.','Darhol pul to‘lang va hech kimga aytmang.'),B('Stop engaging, avoid forwarding images, preserve relevant messages, tell a trusted adult and report.','Yozishishni to‘xtating, tasvirlarni tarqatmang, kerakli xabarlarni saqlang, ishonchli kattaga ayting va shikoyat qiling.'),B('Threaten the account back publicly.','Akkauntni omma oldida javoban tahdid qiling.')],correct:1,why:B('Secrecy and fear help an abuser keep control. The student deserves prompt support. Preserve messages without copying or sharing sensitive images.','Yashirish va qo‘rquv zo‘ravonning nazoratini kuchaytiradi. O‘quvchi tezda yordam olishi kerak. Maxfiy tasvirlarni nusxalamasdan yoki tarqatmasdan tegishli xabarlarni saqlang.')}
];
const EXAM=[
 // Emotional awareness (4)
 {cat:0,q:B('A new study app says your account will be deleted in 60 seconds unless you upload your passport photo. You feel your heart race. What is the most useful first move?','Yangi o‘quv ilovasi 60 soniya ichida pasport suratini yuklamasangiz hisobingiz o‘chishini aytdi. Hayajonlandingiz. Birinchi oqilona qadam nima?'),o:[B('Upload immediately so you do not lose access.','Hisob yo‘qolmasligi uchun darhol yuklash.'),B('Pause and independently verify the requirement in the real app or official help channel.','To‘xtab, talabni haqiqiy ilova yoki rasmiy yordam kanalidan tekshirish.'),B('Send your photo only if the page looks professional.','Sahifa chiroyli bo‘lsagina surat yuborish.'),B('Ask the suspicious pop-up for more time.','Shubhali oynadan ko‘proq vaqt so‘rash.')],a:1,why:B('A countdown is pressure, not evidence. Check through a route you independently trust.','Teskari hisob — dalil emas, bosim. Mustaqil ishonchli kanal orqali tekshiring.')},
 {cat:0,q:B('A message says, “Only the smartest students recognize this secret offer. Prove you belong by sharing your phone number.” Which response shows emotional awareness?','“Faqat eng aqlli o‘quvchilar bu maxfiy taklifni tushunadi. Telefon raqamingizni yuborib munosibligingizni isbotlang”, deyilgan xabar keldi. Qaysi javob hissiy ongni ko‘rsatadi?'),o:[B('Recognize the flattery, pause, and evaluate the request without giving personal data.','Maqtov ta’sirini payqab, to‘xtash va shaxsiy ma’lumotsiz so‘rovni baholash.'),B('Share your number because the message is positive.','Ijobiy xabar bo‘lgani uchun raqamni yuborish.'),B('Reply with someone else’s phone number.','Boshqa odamning raqamini yuborish.'),B('Assume every compliment is always a scam.','Har qanday maqtovni albatta firibgarlik deyish.')],a:0,why:B('Flattery can create a feeling of special status. You can notice that feeling without assuming every compliment is malicious.','Maqtov o‘zingizni alohida his qildirishi mumkin. Bu tuyg‘uni payqang, lekin har bir maqtovni yomon niyat deb bilmang.')},
 {cat:0,q:B('A message from an unknown account says, “If you care about your friend, send money NOW.” What is being targeted?','Notanish akkaunt: “Do‘stingni hurmat qilsang, HOZIROQ pul yubor”, dedi. Nimadan foydalanmoqda?'),o:[B('Only the battery level of your phone.','Faqat telefon quvvatidan.'),B('Your preference for short messages.','Qisqa xabarlarga qiziqishingizdan.'),B('Guilt and urgency to shorten your decision time.','Aybdorlik hissi va shoshilinchlik orqali fikrlash vaqtini kamaytirishdan.'),B('A guaranteed school policy.','Maktabning aniq qoidasidan.')],a:2,why:B('Manipulation often combines a normal emotion with pressure to act before verification.','Manipulyatsiya odatiy hissiyot va tekshirmasdan harakat qilish bosimini birlashtiradi.')},
 {cat:0,q:B('You are excited about winning a tablet, but the notification asks for a small “verification payment.” What is the best internal question?','Planshet yutganingizdan xursandsiz, ammo bildirishnoma “tasdiqlash to‘lovi”ni so‘ramoqda. O‘zingizga qaysi savolni bergan ma’qul?'),o:[B('How fast can I pay?','Qanchalik tez to‘lay olaman?'),B('Can I hide this purchase from my family?','Bu to‘lovni oilamdan yashira olamanmi?'),B('Does excitement make this offer true?','Hayajon taklifni rost qiladimi?'),B('Am I being rushed by a reward, and how can I check it independently?','Sovrin bilan shoshirishyaptimi va buni mustaqil qanday tekshiraman?')],a:3,why:B('Notice what you feel, then move from emotion to independent evidence.','Hissiyotni tan oling, keyin mustaqil dalillarni tekshiring.')},
 // Critical thinking (4)
 {cat:1,q:B('Three websites repeat the same shocking claim, and all three quote one anonymous social post. What do you actually have?','Uchta sayt bir xil hayratli xabarni tarqatmoqda. Barchasi bitta anonim postga tayangan. Sizda aslida nima bor?'),o:[B('Three independent confirmations.','Uchta mustaqil tasdiq.'),B('One unverified claim repeated three times.','Uch marta takrorlangan bitta tasdiqlanmagan xabar.'),B('Proof because all websites have HTTPS.','Hamma sayt HTTPS bo‘lgani uchun isbot.'),B('Evidence that the claim must be false.','Xabar albatta yolg‘onligiga dalil.')],a:1,why:B('Repeated copies do not create independent corroboration. Follow claims to original evidence.','Takroriy nusxalar mustaqil dalil emas. Dastlabki ishonchli manbani izlang.')},
 {cat:1,q:B('A beautifully edited infographic claims a university entrance rule has changed. What evidence matters most?','Chiroyli infografikada universitetga kirish qoidasi o‘zgargani aytilgan. Qaysi dalil eng muhim?'),o:[B('Its colors and typography.','Ranglari va shriftlari.'),B('The number of emojis in comments.','Izohlardagi emojilar soni.'),B('The official institution’s published rule and date, checked independently.','Tegishli tashkilotning mustaqil tekshirilgan rasmiy qoidasi va sanasi.'),B('Whether a friend liked it.','Do‘stingizga yoqqan-yoqmaganligi.')],a:2,why:B('Official primary information and dates matter more than design polish.','Rasmiy birlamchi ma’lumot va sana dizayndan muhimroq.')},
 {cat:1,q:B('A little-known student blog posts a claim with a link to an official public dataset. What is the fair approach?','Kam tanilgan o‘quvchi blogida rasmiy ochiq ma’lumotlar bazasiga havola bilan xabar chop etildi. Adolatli yondashuv qanday?'),o:[B('Reject it only because the blog is small.','Blog kichik bo‘lgani uchungina rad etish.'),B('Trust it only because it links somewhere.','Havolasi borligi uchun darhol ishonish.'),B('Check the cited data, context and whether the conclusion actually follows.','Havoladagi ma’lumot, kontekst va xulosa mosligini tekshirish.'),B('Share it before reading.','O‘qimasdan ulashish.')],a:2,why:B('Critical thinking avoids blind trust and blind dismissal. Check what the evidence supports.','Tanqidiy fikrlash ko‘r-ko‘rona ishonch ham, rad etish ham emas. Dalil nimani tasdiqlashini tekshiring.')},
 {cat:1,q:B('A realistic video seems to show a teacher making an unexpected announcement. What is the strongest conclusion from the video alone?','Haqiqiyga o‘xshagan videoda o‘qituvchi kutilmagan e’lon qilayotgandek. Faqat videoga qarab qanday xulosa qilish mumkin?'),o:[B('It is definitely genuine.','Bu aniq haqiqiy.'),B('It is definitely AI-generated.','Bu aniq AI yaratgan.'),B('Its view count proves the announcement.','Ko‘rishlar soni e’lonni isbotlaydi.'),B('Its authenticity is not established; check through an independent trusted channel.','Haqiqiyligi aniqlanmagan; mustaqil ishonchli kanal orqali tekshirish kerak.')],a:3,why:B('Neither realism nor suspicion alone proves identity or authenticity.','Haqiqiyga o‘xshashlik ham, gumon ham o‘zi isbot emas.')},
 // verification (4)
 {cat:2,q:B('A family member calls from an unknown number asking you to send money to a new account. They sound exactly right. What next?','Oila a’zosi notanish raqamdan qo‘ng‘iroq qilib, yangi hisobga pul yuborishni so‘radi. Ovozi juda tanish. Keyingi qadam?'),o:[B('Transfer money because their voice matches.','Ovozi tanish bo‘lgani uchun pul yuborish.'),B('Call the saved number you already know or verify in person.','Oldindan saqlangan raqamga qayta qo‘ng‘iroq qilish yoki yuzma-yuz tekshirish.'),B('Ask the same unknown number to repeat the request.','O‘sha notanish raqamdan so‘rovni takrorlashni so‘rash.'),B('Post the recording publicly.','Yozuvni ommaga chiqarish.')],a:1,why:B('Verification should use a separate, established path—not the suspicious contact.','Tekshiruv shubhali aloqa emas, alohida oldindan ishonchli kanal orqali bo‘lsin.')},
 {cat:2,q:B('An email says it is from a streaming service and asks you to log in at its attached link. You want to check your bill. What is best?','Email video xizmati nomidan kelib, biriktirilgan havolada tizimga kirishni so‘radi. To‘lovni tekshirmoqchisiz. Eng yaxshi yo‘l?'),o:[B('Open the app or type the service’s known official address yourself.','Ilovani o‘zingiz oching yoki xizmatning oldindan ma’lum rasmiy manzilini kiriting.'),B('Use the email link because it has a padlock icon.','Qulf belgisi uchun email havolasidan foydalaning.'),B('Reply with your password for verification.','Tekshirish uchun parolni yuboring.'),B('Forward the email to every contact.','Emailni hammaga yuboring.')],a:0,why:B('HTTPS does not establish that a site belongs to the organization it imitates. Go independently.','HTTPS sayt aynan o‘sha tashkilotga tegishli ekanini isbotlamaydi. Mustaqil kiring.')},
 {cat:2,q:B('Your school group’s familiar admin account suddenly asks everyone for login codes. Which fact matters?','Maktab guruhidagi tanish administrator akkaunti to‘satdan hammadan kirish kodini so‘radi. Qaysi holat muhim?'),o:[B('Familiar accounts can be compromised; confirm with the person another way.','Tanish akkaunt ham egallangan bo‘lishi mumkin; odam bilan boshqa yo‘l orqali bog‘laning.'),B('Admin accounts cannot be hacked.','Administrator akkauntlari buzilmaydi.'),B('Codes are safe if requested in a group.','Guruhda so‘ralgan kod xavfsiz.'),B('A profile picture confirms identity.','Profil rasmi shaxsni isbotlaydi.')],a:0,why:B('Trust in an old relationship does not guarantee current control of an account.','Avvalgi tanishlik akkauntni hozir ham o‘sha odam boshqarayotganini kafolatlamaydi.')},
 {cat:2,q:B('A QR code on a poster promises free concert tickets and opens an unfamiliar payment page. How should you verify it?','E’londagi QR-kod bepul konsert chiptasi va’da qiladi, ammo notanish to‘lov sahifasini ochadi. Qanday tekshirasiz?'),o:[B('A printed QR code must be safe.','Bosma QR-kod albatta xavfsiz.'),B('Trust the payment page’s own claims.','To‘lov sahifasining o‘z da’vosiga ishoning.'),B('Find the organizer’s official ticket channel independently before entering information.','Ma’lumot kiritishdan oldin tashkilotchining rasmiy chipta kanalini mustaqil toping.'),B('Pay quickly before the offer disappears.','Taklif yo‘qolmasdan tez to‘lang.')],a:2,why:B('QR codes can lead to untrusted websites; the same verification principle applies.','QR-kodlar ham ishonchsiz saytlarga olib borishi mumkin; tekshirish tamoyili bir xil.')},
 // Everyday protection (4)
 {cat:3,q:B('You use one password for three accounts. One service announces a breach. What preventive habit would have reduced the risk?','Uchta hisobda bitta paroldan foydalanasiz. Xizmatlardan birida ma’lumotlar sizib chiqdi. Qaysi odat xavfni kamaytirardi?'),o:[B('Reusing a longer version of the same password everywhere.','Bir xil parolning uzunroq shaklini hamma joyda ishlatish.'),B('Giving the password to a friend for safekeeping.','Parolni do‘stga saqlash uchun berish.'),B('Turning off device updates.','Qurilma yangilanishlarini o‘chirish.'),B('Unique passwords per account, ideally kept in a password manager.','Har bir hisobga alohida parol, imkon bo‘lsa parol menejerida.')],a:3,why:B('Unique passwords limit damage when one site loses account information.','Alohida parollar bitta xizmatdagi sizib chiqish oqibatini cheklaydi.')},
 {cat:3,q:B('Someone you did not contact asks for the six-digit login code that arrived on your phone. What do you do?','Siz murojaat qilmagan odam telefonga kelgan olti xonali kirish kodini so‘rayapti. Nima qilasiz?'),o:[B('Share it if they know your name.','Ismingizni bilsa yuboring.'),B('Never share it; use the service’s official app or support to investigate.','Kodni bermang; holatni xizmatning rasmiy ilovasi yoki yordami orqali tekshiring.'),B('Share only the first five digits.','Faqat dastlabki besh raqamni yuboring.'),B('Post the code in a school group.','Kodni maktab guruhiga joylang.')],a:1,why:B('Authentication codes authorize access; someone asking you to reveal them is a major warning sign.','Tasdiqlash kodi kirish imkonini beradi; uni oshkor qilishni so‘rash katta ogohlantirish belgisidir.')},
 {cat:3,q:B('A friend sends an unexpected installation file claiming it is a school tool. What is safest?','Do‘stingiz maktab dasturi deb kutilmagan o‘rnatish faylini yubordi. Eng xavfsiz yo‘l?'),o:[B('Install it immediately because the sender is familiar.','Yuboruvchi tanish bo‘lgani uchun darhol o‘rnatish.'),B('Disable your phone security settings to install it.','O‘rnatish uchun himoyani o‘chirish.'),B('Confirm the app through the school and obtain it only from approved official sources.','Dasturni maktabdan tasdiqlatib, faqat rasmiy tasdiqlangan manbadan olish.'),B('Send it to younger students to test.','Sinash uchun kichik sinflarga yuborish.')],a:2,why:B('A known sender may also have a compromised account. Avoid unverified software.','Tanish odamning akkaunti ham egallangan bo‘lishi mumkin. Tasdiqlanmagan dasturdan saqlaning.')},
 {cat:3,q:B('You want to post a photo of your competition certificate. It shows your ID number and phone. What is a thoughtful choice?','Tanlov sertifikati rasmini joylamoqchisiz. Unda ID raqam va telefon bor. Ehtiyotkor qaror qaysi?'),o:[B('Post everything because certificates are positive news.','Sertifikat quvonchli xabar, hammasini joylash.'),B('Blur or cover unnecessary personal details and consider who can see the post.','Keraksiz shaxsiy ma’lumotlarni yopish va postni kim ko‘rishini o‘ylash.'),B('Add your home address to prove authenticity.','Haqiqiyligini isbotlash uchun uy manzilini qo‘shish.'),B('Share your passwords alongside the photo.','Surat bilan birga parollarni ulashish.')],a:1,why:B('Share the achievement without exposing information that others do not need.','Yutug‘ingizni ulashing, ammo boshqalarga keraksiz shaxsiy ma’lumotlarni ochmang.')},
 // Response and recovery (4)
 {cat:4,q:B('You opened a suspicious page but did not download anything or enter data. What is the sensible next step?','Shubhali sahifani ochdingiz, ammo hech narsa yuklamadingiz va ma’lumot kiritmadingiz. Oqilona keyingi qadam?'),o:[B('Assume your whole life is permanently compromised.','Hamma ma’lumotlarim butunlay yo‘qoldi deb o‘ylash.'),B('Enter your password to confirm you are safe.','Xavfsizlikni tekshirish uchun parol kiritish.'),B('Close the page, do not follow instructions, keep your device updated, and report the suspicious link.','Sahifani yoping, ko‘rsatmalarga amal qilmang, qurilmani yangilab turing va shubhali havola haqida xabar bering.'),B('Share the link so classmates can inspect it.','Sinfdoshlar tekshirishi uchun havolani yuborish.')],a:2,why:B('Simply opening a link is not the same as submitting a password or installing software, but caution and reporting are still useful.','Havolani ochish parol kiritish yoki dastur o‘rnatishga teng emas, lekin ehtiyotkorlik va xabar berish kerak.')},
 {cat:4,q:B('You entered an account password into a page you now believe was fake. What should you do first?','Soxta bo‘lishi mumkin bo‘lgan sahifaga akkaunt parolini kiritdingiz. Avval nima qilish kerak?'),o:[B('Change it immediately through the genuine app/site, review sessions and enable MFA; tell a trusted adult if needed.','Haqiqiy ilova/sayt orqali parolni darhol o‘zgartirish, sessiyalarni tekshirish, MFA yoqish va kerak bo‘lsa kattaga aytish.'),B('Wait a month because changing passwords is embarrassing.','Uyalgani uchun bir oy kutish.'),B('Send your new password to the suspicious site.','Yangi parolni ham shubhali saytga yuborish.'),B('Delete all evidence and tell nobody.','Hamma dalilni o‘chirib, hech kimga aytmaslik.')],a:0,why:B('Use an independent official route to secure the account and revoke unauthorized sessions. Speed helps contain damage.','Mustaqil rasmiy kanal orqali hisobni himoyalang va begona sessiyalarni tugating. Tez harakat zararni kamaytiradi.')},
 {cat:4,q:B('A student was deceived into sending money to a fake store. What is the most helpful immediate response?','O‘quvchi soxta do‘konga pul yuborib qo‘ydi. Eng foydali tezkor harakat qaysi?'),o:[B('Publicly shame the student so others learn.','Boshqalar o‘rgansin deb o‘quvchini uyaltirish.'),B('Trust a stranger promising guaranteed recovery for an extra fee.','Qo‘shimcha to‘lov evaziga pulni albatta qaytarishni va’da qilgan odamga ishonish.'),B('Do nothing because mistakes are irreversible.','Xatoni tuzatib bo‘lmaydi deb hech narsa qilmaslik.'),B('Tell a trusted adult, contact the bank/payment provider via official channels promptly, preserve transaction details and report.','Ishonchli kattaga aytish, bank/to‘lov xizmatiga rasmiy kanal orqali tez murojaat qilish, tranzaksiya ma’lumotini saqlash va shikoyat qilish.')],a:3,why:B('Early reporting can improve response options. Beware of “recovery” scammers who demand more money.','Tez xabar berish choralar ko‘rishga yordam beradi. Pulni qaytarish bahonasida qo‘shimcha pul so‘raydiganlardan ehtiyot bo‘ling.')},
 {cat:4,q:B('A stranger threatens to share someone’s private images unless they obey. What response best supports the student?','Notanish odam o‘quvchining shaxsiy tasvirlarini tarqatish bilan tahdid qilmoqda. Qaysi yordam to‘g‘ri?'),o:[B('Tell them to keep the secret and pay.','Sir saqlashni va pul to‘lashni aytish.'),B('Do not forward images; tell a trusted adult, preserve relevant messages, report through the platform and seek official help.','Tasvirlarni tarqatmaslik, ishonchli kattaga aytish, tegishli xabarlarni saqlash, platformada shikoyat qilish va rasmiy yordam so‘rash.'),B('Repost the threat to expose the victim.','Jabrlanuvchini oshkor qilib tahdidni qayta tarqatish.'),B('Blame the student for being targeted.','Tahdid uchun o‘quvchini ayblash.')],a:1,why:B('No student should face threats alone. Support and appropriate reporting matter; never spread private imagery.','Hech bir o‘quvchi tahdidga yolg‘iz duch kelmasligi kerak. Yordam va shikoyat muhim; shaxsiy tasvirlarni tarqatmang.')}
];
const SOURCES=[
 {name:'NIST — Creating a Culture of Security',desc:B('Interactive, realistic, actionable and testable education over repetitive lectures.','Oddiy ma’ruzadan ko‘ra interaktiv, hayotiy va baholanadigan ta’lim.'),url:'https://www.nist.gov/blogs/manufacturing-innovation-blog/creating-culture-security'},
 {name:'UK Stop! Think Fraud — Recognise the tactics',desc:B('Authority, urgency, emotion and other common manipulation patterns.','Obro‘, shoshilinchlik, hissiyot va boshqa manipulyatsiyalar.'),url:'https://stopthinkfraud.campaign.gov.uk/how-to-spot-fraud/recognise-the-tactics/'},
 {name:'FTC — How to Avoid a Scam',desc:B('Scam recognition, independent checks and reporting.','Firibgarlikni aniqlash, mustaqil tekshirish va xabar berish.'),url:'https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/how-avoid-scam'},
 {name:'FBI — AI-generated voice and messaging impersonation (2025)',desc:B('Familiar-sounding voices are not sufficient identity evidence; verify using a known channel.','Tanish ovoz shaxsni isbotlamaydi; ishonchli kanal orqali tekshiring.'),url:'https://www.fbi.gov/investigate/cyber/alerts/2025/senior-us-officials-impersonated-in-malicious-messaging-campaign'},
 {name:'FBI IC3 — Generative AI and financial fraud (2024)',desc:B('Examples of generated messages, identity documents and video used in fraud.','Firibgarlikda sun’iy matn, hujjat va videodan foydalanish misollari.'),url:'https://www.ic3.gov/PSA/2024/PSA241203'},
 {name:'CISA — Secure Our World: Four Ways to Stay Safe',desc:B('Phishing, MFA, unique passwords and updates.','Fishing, ko‘p bosqichli tasdiqlash, noyob parollar va yangilanishlar.'),url:'https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2024-09/Secure-Our-World-4-Easy-Ways-Stay-Safe-Online-Tip-Sheet.pdf'},
 {name:'Stanford / Cambridge et al. — Psychological inoculation (2022)',desc:B('Controlled studies on teaching people to recognize manipulation techniques.','Manipulyatsiyani tanish ko‘nikmasi bo‘yicha nazoratli tadqiqotlar.'),url:'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9401631/'},
 {name:'Simchon et al. — Meta-analysis on inoculation (2025)',desc:B('Evidence for gains in distinguishing credible from manipulative content, with limitations.','Ishonchli va manipulyativ mazmunni farqlashdagi o‘sish va cheklovlar.'),url:'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41151144/'},
 {name:'Civic Online Reasoning — Lateral reading study (2021)',desc:B('Students learn to leave a site and check independent sources.','O‘quvchilar saytdan chiqib, mustaqil manbalarni tekshirishni o‘rganadi.'),url:'https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s41235-021-00291-4'},
 {name:'UNICEF Uzbekistan — Protecting Children Online (2025)',desc:B('Child privacy, wellbeing, online harm and child-centered support.','Bolalar maxfiyligi, farovonligi va internetda himoya qilish.'),url:'https://www.unicef.org/uzbekistan/en/stories/protecting-children-online'},
 {name:'UZCERT — Questions & Answers',desc:B('Uzbekistan-specific reporting routes for phishing, hacked accounts and financial fraud.','O‘zbekistonda fishing, buzilgan hisob va moliyaviy firibgarlik bo‘yicha yordam yo‘llari.'),url:'https://uzcert.uz/en/questions-answers/'},
 {name:'Government of Uzbekistan — Telegram and suspicious app warning',desc:B('Local examples involving unfamiliar APK files and messaging-platform scams.','Notanish APK-fayllar va messenjer firibgarligi haqida mahalliy ogohlantirish.'),url:'https://gov.uz/en/bekobod/news/view/233523'}
];
const STORAGE='second-thought-offline-v1';
const initial=()=>({lang:'uz',langUserSelected:false,collapsed:false,labs:{},labAnswers:{},labChecks:{},missionAnswers:{},missionIndex:0,quizAnswers:{},quizIndex:0,submitted:false,homeAnswer:'',choiceOrders:null,registered:false});
let state=initial();try{const value=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE));if(value&&typeof value==='object'){state={...state,...value};if(!state.langUserSelected)state.lang='uz';}}catch{}
function newChoiceOrders(){return EXAM.map(q=>{const order=q.o.map((_,i)=>i);for(let i=order.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[order[i],order[j]]=[order[j],order[i]];}return order;});}
if(!Array.isArray(state.choiceOrders)||state.choiceOrders.length!==EXAM.length){state.choiceOrders=newChoiceOrders();try{localStorage.setItem(STORAGE,JSON.stringify(state));}catch{}}
let directoryPromise;
function loadDirectory(){return directoryPromise??=fetch('/uzbekistan-schools.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('Directory unavailable');return r.json();});}
let view='home';
const S=document.getElementById('screen'),rail=document.getElementById('rail');
const l=x=>x&&typeof x==='object'&&Object.hasOwn(x,'en')?(x[state.lang]||x.en):String(x??'');
const t=key=>l(text[key]);
const e=x=>String(x??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const E=x=>e(l(x));
const doneLabs=()=>Object.values(state.labs).filter(Boolean).length;
const doneMissions=()=>Object.keys(state.missionAnswers).length;
const doneTest=()=>Object.keys(state.quizAnswers).length;
const canTest=()=>doneLabs()===5&&doneMissions()===6;
const overall=()=>Math.round((doneLabs()+doneMissions()+(state.submitted?20:doneTest()))/31*100);
const pick=(lab)=>state.labAnswers[lab]===undefined?null:Number(state.labAnswers[lab]);
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORAGE,JSON.stringify(state));}catch{}}
function navigate(v){view=v;if(v==='test'&&!canTest()&&!state.submitted){view='locked';}if(v==='registration'&&(!state.submitted||resultStats().total<16)){view='results';}render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});rail.classList.remove('mobileopen');document.getElementById('overlay').classList.remove('show');}
const foot=()=>`<footer class="footer"><span>${e(t('footer'))} · 2026</span><span>${e(t('privacy'))}</span></footer>`;
const kicker=(s)=>`<div class="section-kicker">${e(s)}</div>`;
function navrender(){
 const uz=state.lang==='uz';
 const items=[
  {v:'home',glyph:'⌂',name:t('home')},
  {v:'lab-0',glyph:'01',name:l(CATS[0]),complete:state.labs[0]},
  {v:'lab-1',glyph:'02',name:l(CATS[1]),complete:state.labs[1]},
  {v:'lab-2',glyph:'03',name:l(CATS[2]),complete:state.labs[2]},
  {v:'lab-3',glyph:'04',name:l(CATS[3]),complete:state.labs[3]},
  {v:'lab-4',glyph:'05',name:l(CATS[4]),complete:state.labs[4]},
  {v:'missions',glyph:'◎',name:uz?'Amaliy vaziyatlar':'Practice scenarios',note:`${doneMissions()}/6`},
  {v:'test',glyph:'✓',name:uz?'Yakuniy sinov':'Final assessment',note:state.submitted?'✓':`${doneTest()}/20`},
  {v:'guide',glyph:'▤',name:uz?'Foydali qo‘llanma':'Safety guide'},
  {v:'sources',glyph:'↗',name:t('source')}
 ];
 let out=`<div class="navcaption">${uz?'BOSH SAHIFA':'WELCOME'}</div>`;
 items.forEach((it,i)=>{
  if(i===1)out+=`<div class="navcaption navchapter"><span class="nav-chapter-num">01</span>${uz?'BILIB OLING · 5 DARS':'LEARN · 5 LESSONS'}</div>`;
  if(i===6)out+=`<div class="navcaption navchapter"><span class="nav-chapter-num">02</span>${uz?'MASHQ QILING':'PRACTICE'}</div>`;
  if(i===7)out+=`<div class="navcaption navchapter"><span class="nav-chapter-num">03</span>${uz?'BILIMNI SINANG':'CHECK YOUR SKILLS'}</div>`;
  if(i===8)out+=`<div class="navcaption navchapter"><span class="nav-chapter-num">?</span>${uz?'YORDAM':'REFERENCE'}</div>`;
  const active=it.v===view||(view==='locked'&&it.v==='test')||(view==='results'&&it.v==='test');
  out+=`<button type="button" class="navitem ${active?'active':''} ${it.complete?'isdone':''}" data-action="navigate" data-value="${it.v}" title="${e(it.name)}" ${active?'aria-current="page"':''}><span class="navglyph">${it.complete?'✓':it.glyph}</span><span class="nav-text">${e(it.name)}</span>${it.note?`<span class="nav-index">${it.note}</span>`:''}</button>`;
 });
 document.getElementById('sideNav').innerHTML=out;
 document.getElementById('headProgress').textContent=overall()+'% '+(uz?'bajarildi':'complete');
 const prog=document.getElementById('headProgressBar');if(prog)prog.style.width=overall()+'%';
 const label=view.startsWith('lab-')?`${uz?'DARS':'LESSON'} ${Number(view.slice(4))+1} / 5 · ${l(LABS[Number(view.slice(4))].name)}`:view==='home'?(uz?'Bosh sahifa':'Home'):view==='results'?t('resultsTitle'):view==='locked'?t('test'):view==='missions'?(uz?'Amaliy vaziyatlar':'Scenarios'):view==='test'?(uz?'Yakuniy sinov':'Assessment'):view==='guide'?t('guide'):view==='sources'?t('sources'):view;
 document.getElementById('breadcrumb').textContent=label;
 document.querySelectorAll('.lang-switch button').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.value===state.lang);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.value===state.lang));});
 document.getElementById('brandCaption').textContent=uz?'KIBERXAVFSIZLIK MADANIYATI':'CYBERSECURITY CULTURE';
 document.getElementById('railFooter').innerHTML=uz?'KOD YOZISH EMAS.<br>TO‘G‘RI QAROR QILISH.<br><span style="color:#f7ab87">2026 / O‘QUV TAJRIBASI</span>':'NO CODE REQUIRED.<br>BETTER DECISIONS.<br><span style="color:#f7ab87">2026 / STUDENT LAB</span>';
 rail.classList.toggle('collapsed',!!state.collapsed);
 const c=document.querySelector('.collapsebtn');if(c){c.setAttribute('aria-label',uz?(state.collapsed?'Menyuni ochish':'Menyuni yig‘ish'):(state.collapsed?'Expand menu':'Collapse menu'));c.title=c.getAttribute('aria-label');}
}
